<Page
  title="Pediatric Visit Coding — Well Visit CPT Codes by Age, and Documenting Them Defensibly"
  description="Which CPT code applies to a pediatric well visit at each age, new versus established, and how to document a well visit plus a same-day problem so the level survives review. Written for pediatric clinicians and their billers.">

